    "code": "20767493_EA",
    "name": "2 Year Aged Cheddar Cheese",
    "description": "<p>Balderson's 2 Year Old Cheddar Cheese is carefully aged to develop a robust, full-bodied flavour with a satisfying sharpness. Over two years of maturation give this cheddar a firmer texture and a slightly crumbly consistency, perfect for those who appreciate a more intense, extra old cheddar. With its pale yellow colour and rich, tangy taste, Balderson's 2 year cheddar is an excellent choice for cheese lovers seeking depth and character in every bite. Ideal for pairing with crackers, fruit, or adding complexity to cooked dishes, it delivers a truly elevated cheese experience. Since 1881, Balderson has been dedicated to aging premium cheese in Ontario. While the world has evolved, our commitment to quality and craftsmanship remains unchanged. Balderson cheese is a premium brand cherished by Canadians for over 140 years, known for its exceptional taste and meticulous attention to detail.</p><ul><li>Premium, sharp aged cheddar flavour</li><li>Firmer, slightly crumbly texture</li><li>Pale yellow colour</li><li>Aged 2 years</li><li>Crafted by Balderson with over 140 years of cheesemaking expertise</li><li>Premium brand with exceptional taste</li><li>280 g</li></ul>",
